* SPICE Netlist

VCC 2 0 DC VCC ; Voltage source VCC between node 2 and ground

R1 2 1 R1 ; Resistor R1 between node 2 and node 1
R2 1 0 R2 ; Resistor R2 between node 1 and ground

I1 2 3 DC I1 ; Current source I1 between node 2 and node 3

Q1 2 1 3 Q1_NPN ; NPN Transistor Q1, with collector at node 2, base at node 1, emitter at node 3

.model Q1_NPN NPN